# The large test scene, which scripts/fetch-scene.py brings down. The geometry
# is one 133 MiB file and GitHub refuses anything over 100 MiB. The scene file
# and the notes beside it are in git, and only the model is not. See issue #130.
scenes/*/models/

# A note between sessions, not part of the repository. The `handover` skill
# writes it, the next session reads it and deletes it.
handover.md
